flowchart TD
  R[Read dashboard or categories] --> K[key t:tenantId:name]
  K --> H{Cache hit?}
  H -->|yes| RET[Return cached]
  H -->|no| SF[Single-flight lock per key]
  SF --> DBQ[Query database]
  DBQ --> PUT[Put with TTL]
  PUT --> RET
  W[Write ticket] --> INV[Invalidate tenant keys after commit]
  RD[(Redis down)] -.->|fail open to DB, count error| DBQ
